flowchart TD
    Q[Investigator question in TrialIQ] --> MODE{Selected workflow mode}
    MODE -->|Direct| DIRECT[Deterministic overview/query service]
    DIRECT --> EVIDENCE[Loaded source-backed evidence]
    EVIDENCE --> DANSWER[Deterministic grounded answer]

    MODE -->|Guided| INTENT[LLM call 1\nExtractedQueryIntent]
    INTENT --> SUP[TrialIQ Supervisor]
    SUP --> MCP[FastMCP governed retrieval]
    MCP --> GRAPH[Bounded Neo4j evidence]
    GRAPH --> METRICS[Deterministic metrics]
    METRICS --> WIDTH{More than 6 candidates?}
    WIDTH -->|No| VALIDATE[Deterministic validation]
    WIDTH -->|Yes| HUMAN[Investigator selects evidence set]
    HUMAN --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> SYNTH[LLM call 2\nStructuredSynthesis]
    SYNTH --> GANSWER[Grounded guided answer]

    DANSWER --> UI[Answer / Studies / Connections / Evidence]
    GANSWER --> UI
